    "title": "Sample Retrieval System for Deep-Sea ROV",
    "description": "For the capstone of my mechanical engineering degree, I worked on a research project focused on the use of a pressure-compensated, deep-sea ROV to retrieve specimen samples from glass sponges in the Howe Sound.\n\nMy primary tasks:\n\n- Co-led the team over the course of the project, managing the project schedule and allocating tasks\n\n- Led the software development effort for the project, designing and implementing a control algorithm for the Sample Retrieval System prototype in Python on a Beagle Bone Black\n\n- Assisted with the fabrication of mechanical and electrical sub-systems for the Sample Retrieval System prototype.",
